{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2021-12-14 09:30:00', 'title': "SANDIE O'CONNOR ELECTED TO THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF BNY MELLON", 'text': 'NEW YORK, DEC.\xa014, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON CORPORATION ("BNY MELLON") (NYSE: BK) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED SANDIE O\'CONNOR AS AN INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR, EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 13, 2021.\xa0 WITH THE ADDITION OF MS.'}